Note on flake.lock
==================

This repository intentionally ships `flake.nix` without a committed
`flake.lock`. Generate it locally with:

    nix flake lock

For reproducible builds across machines, commit the resulting
`flake.lock`. For now it is left to the user to generate so this file
is a placeholder reminder — it is NOT consumed by git/.gitignore
automatically. If you want flake.lock excluded from git, add
`flake.lock` to .gitignore. Otherwise commit it after `nix flake lock`.
